d": "toolu_016TLE91TCV1d1HzEifaQzZY", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53038, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016TLE91TCV1d1HzEifaQzZY", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54560, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017SZPvvbdM8xJYNkzvmck1f", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54860, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017SZPvvbdM8xJYNkzvmck1f", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54860, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017SZPvvbdM8xJYNkzvmck1f", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59264, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as **INC-0001**.\n\n1. **Problem:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release; v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) were both unhealthy.\n2. **Rollback:** The first rollback to v2.3.0 stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1. Repeating it was safe since it targets the same version, so I retried once and it finished in us-west and eu-west.\n3. **Check:** All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n4. **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a duplicate or page on-call twice. The incident description covers the failure, the partial rollback and retry, the current state, and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EX3wzN4XptG3GmEQHH2six", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CiwFY9hYJuqCmdGYk89RsH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018Q6rLyqoQA7HAmWfdz5yiw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015awBWvUBi5fxZUdJhL8CqB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back. The rollback is safe to repeat because it targets the same version, so I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PfH8toW2sdymCdQDt1ie7w", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017msjTggmRFh8q2qx9eZUFL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RDArKjZCiWTVacAb5wvaMa", "caller": {"ty