nce it targets the same version, so I retried once and it finished in us-west and eu-west.\n3. **Check:** All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n4. **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a duplicate or page on-call twice. The incident description covers the failure, the partial rollback and retry, the current state, and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}